+/**
+  * @brief  usb open phy clock
+  * @param  usbx: to select the otgfs peripheral.
+  *         this parameter can be one of the following values:
+  *         - OTG1_GLOBAL
+  *         - OTG2_GLOBAL
+  * @retval none
